17:["$","p","You can book a free appointment with one of our highly skilled “Application and Counselling Team” who are experts in study abroad counselling and have first-hand experience for guiding students to achieve their right path.",{"children":"You can book a free appointment with one of our highly skilled “Application and Counselling Team” who are experts in study abroad counselling and have first-hand experience for guiding students to achieve their right path."}]
